1
00:00:02,127 --> 00:00:04,967
So if you are considering
going into experimental physics...

2
00:00:05,130 --> 00:00:06,920
(Leonard:)...my door is always open.

3
00:00:07,090 --> 00:00:09,930
(Leonard:)Again, I'm sorry that the demonstration
didn't quite work out.

4
00:00:10,093 --> 00:00:11,383
(Leonard:)Now we know what happens...

5
00:00:11,553 --> 00:00:15,893
(Leonard:)...when you accidentally spill peach
Snapple into a helium-neon laser.

6
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:19,767
The short answer is don't.

7
00:00:24,149 --> 00:00:26,859
(Leonard:)Now to tell you about
the Theoretical Physics Department...

8
00:00:27,027 --> 00:00:28,527
(Leonard:)...is Dr. Sheldon Cooper.

9
00:00:32,782 --> 00:00:35,282
(Leonard:)- Dr. Cooper?
SHELDON: Forget it.

10
00:00:37,078 --> 00:00:38,708
(Leonard:)Excuse me.

11
00:00:39,497 --> 00:00:42,207
(Leonard:)- Sheldon, we both agreed to do this.
SHELDON: It's a waste of time.

12
00:00:42,375 --> 00:00:45,755
I might as well explain thermodynamics
to a bunch of Labradoodles.

13
00:00:48,048 --> 00:00:52,258
(Leonard:)If you don't do this,
I won't take you to the comic-book store.

14
00:00:54,637 --> 00:00:56,217
(Sheldon(entering):)Hello.

15
00:01:00,685 --> 00:01:05,025
(Sheldon(entering):)Nice work with the laser, by the way.

